{"4302450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capybara Pizza Cafe", "steam_appid": 4302450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capybara Pizza Cafe</strong> is a cozy  management game where you manage a pizza cafe run by Capybaras, for Capybaras.  <br> <br>Buy upgrades and improve your own stats. Hire employees to automate most of your tasks. Expand to different locations via your capy travel agent. <br> <br>Set up your own personal office to upgrade your Capybara captain speed, carrying capacity and profit per table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/76b100e5f7955bca01d96f45b454e10b.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/76b100e5f7955bca01d96f45b454e10b.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/76b100e5f7955bca01d96f45b454e10b.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up an HR office to hire more employees, upgrade their movement speed and carrying capacity. You need employees to start automating the pizza cafe, to reduce your own workload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/b14bc2f8d398bcd976713ec6e6730939.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/b14bc2f8d398bcd976713ec6e6730939.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/b14bc2f8d398bcd976713ec6e6730939.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn offline income while you are away. The game calculates your earning rate and multiplies that by the amount of time you are away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/19abd4efc9dec5c259e9bc91d7dd4830.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/19abd4efc9dec5c259e9bc91d7dd4830.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/19abd4efc9dec5c259e9bc91d7dd4830.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multitask by moving intelligently around the cafe. Process the cash register, while still being able to move freshly baked pizzas from the oven to the counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/aa4ccc3057d26844c137d7c964260adc.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/aa4ccc3057d26844c137d7c964260adc.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/aa4ccc3057d26844c137d7c964260adc.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have gathered enough funds, pay a visit to your Travel Agent to expand to the next pizza cafe. Unlock up to 5 different locations, each having a different theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/a6897a4b2b09ef4b499b4d5cf74fbf8f.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/a6897a4b2b09ef4b499b4d5cf74fbf8f.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/a6897a4b2b09ef4b499b4d5cf74fbf8f.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit your Herb Garden to collect fresh herbs. Herbs are needed to craft new delicious pizza recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/6a07726fb390a95367ddb8ddeb7bb1a7.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/6a07726fb390a95367ddb8ddeb7bb1a7.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/6a07726fb390a95367ddb8ddeb7bb1a7.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the Outdoor Market to buy special ingredients for your pizza plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/0b50ee5ac3992c63616eea411b1e5ec2.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/0b50ee5ac3992c63616eea411b1e5ec2.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/0b50ee5ac3992c63616eea411b1e5ec2.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft delicious pizza with various Herbs and market ingredients. Consume the pizza to get special bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/14b24c9bd6ab4299dabb750bbe1d8a2a.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/14b24c9bd6ab4299dabb750bbe1d8a2a.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/14b24c9bd6ab4299dabb750bbe1d8a2a.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the University Classroom to learn new technologies to optimize your cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/c2df526c847f1e98b8bd73741293c5ed.poster.avif?t=1786102190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/c2df526c847f1e98b8bd73741293c5ed.webm?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302450/extras/c2df526c847f1e98b8bd73741293c5ed.mp4?t=1786102190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you at the cafe.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capybara Pizza Cafe</strong> is a cozy  management game where you manage a pizza cafe run by Capybaras, for Capybaras.  <br> <br>Buy upgrades and i